## Interface: 16001, 11601
## Title: Forever Route
## Notes: An adaptive Horde questing route for WoW Forever, planned from ForeverDB.net's quest data. It re-plans as you level, accept and hand in quests, and drops quests that went grey (after a dungeon, say). Type /fr.
## Author: Forever Build Coach
## Version: 0.2.3
## X-License: GPL-3.0
## X-Credits: Data from ForeverDB.net (https://foreverdb.net), including Classic data from CMaNGOS classic-db, and from QuestieDB (https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB). All GPL-3.0.
